titel = "Ponies on Display"
description = "You lead your ponygirls over the market, noticing how everybody is starring.

They often do, but today the attention feels more intense, and your ponygirls notice it too. They blush and fidget, flustered to be paraded almost naked through the streets where everyone can see their tight bondage.

Soon they huff in arousal, cunts dripping and drenching their crotchstraps. You grin to yourself, and keep walking."
